    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζαχρηής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, used
		only in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attacking
				violently, furious, raging</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μένος Βορέαο καὶ ἄλλων ζαχρηῶν
					ἀνέμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.525
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-χρει-</span> most codd.); of
			warriors, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζαχρηεῖς . . κατὰ κρατ ερὰς ὑσμίνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.347
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.684
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζαχραής, ζαχρειής</span>.
			(From <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζᾰ-</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράω</span> (B); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχράω</span> (B).)</div>
